    summary: 'Two Hubble contributions. Added --reply and --not-reply filter flags to hubble observe, exposing the existing server-side ReplyFilter to the CLI as mutually exclusive flags. Separately, authored the accepted design proposal (CFP-26521) to expose the URL path in Hubble HTTP metrics as an opt-in, operator-templated label - templates collapse variable URL segments (IDs, slugs) into stable placeholders so the metric label set stays bounded at config load rather than unbounded at request time.',
