    summary: 'Bumped the indirect dependency github.com/cilium/ebpf from v0.16.0 to v0.22.0 in /agent to clear CVE-2026-10722. The dep arrives transitively via containerd/cgroups/v3/cgroup2, so the fix was go get @v0.22.0 then go mod tidy and go mod vendor. Verified the agent never reaches the vulnerable BTF-parsing path, so the bump clears scanners rather than patching a reachable vulnerability.',
